<%# Renders a stored @-mention as a reference chip (pill + type icon), so references %>
<%# stand out from running text. mentionable = Note | Document. Same chip as a pasted %>
<%# object address (ObjectLinks::Chips, components/object_chip.css). %>
<%# Shared by organisations/notes/_mention and organisations/documents/_mention. %>
<%# A navigable link only when the viewer may open the target (note→document crosses %>
<%# areas); otherwise an inert label, so a chip never backlinks to forbidden content. %>
<%# ActionText hands the thin partials the attachment, not the record: it answers title %>
<%# through delegation, but `is_a?` and `case` see the wrapper, so the path was nil and %>
<%# link_to raised (a 500 on every page that showed a readable mention). Unwrap once here. %>
<% mentionable = mentionable.attachable if mentionable.is_a?(ActionText::Attachment) %>
<% mention_label = mentionable.title.presence || t("views.wiki.mentions.untitled") %>
<% mention_type = mentionable.is_a?(Document) ? "document" : "note" %>
<% mention_icon = mentionable.is_a?(Document) ? "file-earmark-text" : "journal-text" %>
<% if wiki_mention_readable?(mentionable) %>
  <%= link_to wiki_mention_path(mentionable), class: "object-chip object-chip--#{mention_type}", title: mention_label do %><i class="bi bi-<%= mention_icon %>" aria-hidden="true"></i><%= mention_label %><% end %>
<% else %>
  <span class="object-chip object-chip--<%= mention_type %> object-chip--inert" title="<%= mention_label %>"><i class="bi bi-<%= mention_icon %>" aria-hidden="true"></i><%= mention_label %></span>
<% end %>
